#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire immovable: Ship Under Construction
#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for a Frisian immovable: Ship Under Construction
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/amazons/units.lua:1252
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/atlanteans/units.lua:1328
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/barbarians/units.lua:980
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1041
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/frisians/units.lua:1378
msgid "A ship is being constructed at this site."
msgstr "Pe acest loc se construiește o navă."

#. TRANSLATORS: Purpose helptext for an Amazon warehouse: Headquarters
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/amazons/units.lua:1264
msgctxt "amazons_building"
msgid "Accommodation for your people. Also stores your wares and tools."
msgstr "Adăpost pentru oamenii tăi. De asemenea, depozitează bunurile și uneltele tale."

#. TRANSLATORS: Note helptext for an Amazon warehouse: Headquarters
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/amazons/units.lua:1266
msgctxt "amazons_building"
msgid "The headquarters is your main building."
msgstr "Sediul central este clădirea ta principală."

#. TRANSLATORS: Purpose helptext for an Amazon warehouse: Warehouse
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/amazons/units.lua:1273
msgctxt "amazons_building"
msgid ""
"Your workers and soldiers will find shelter here. Also stores your wares and"
" tools."
msgstr "Muncitorii și soldații tăi își vor găsi adăpost aici. De asemenea, depozitează bunurile și uneltele tale."

#. TRANSLATORS: Purpose helptext for an Amazon warehouse: Port
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/amazons/units.lua:1280
msgctxt "amazons_building"
msgid ""
"Serves as a base for overseas colonization and trade. Also stores your "
"soldiers, wares and tools."
msgstr "Servește drept bază pentru colonizarea și comerțul de peste mări. De asemenea, depozitează soldații, bunurile și uneltele tale."

#. TRANSLATORS: Note helptext for an Amazon warehouse: Port
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/amazons/units.lua:1282
msgctxt "amazons_building"
msgid ""
"Similar to the Headquarters a Port can be attacked and destroyed by an "
"enemy. It is recommendable to send soldiers to defend it."
msgstr "La fel ca sediul central, un port poate fi atacat și distrus de un inamic. Este recomandat să trimiți soldați care să-l apere."

#. TRANSLATORS: Purpose helptext for an Amazon market: Market
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/amazons/units.lua:1291
msgctxt "amazons_building"
msgid "A market enables trading with other tribes."
msgstr "O piață permite comerțul cu alte triburi."

#. TRANSLATORS: Purpose helptext for an Amazon production site: Stonecutter's
#. Hut
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/amazons/units.lua:1300
msgctxt "amazons_building"
msgid "Cuts raw pieces of granite out of rocks in the vicinity."
msgstr "Taie bucăți brute de granit din stâncile din apropiere."

#. TRANSLATORS: Note helptext for an Amazon production site: Stonecutter's Hut
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/amazons/units.lua:1302
msgctxt "amazons_building"
msgid "The stonecutter’s hut needs rocks to cut within the work area."
msgstr "Coliba pietrarului are nevoie de stânci de tăiat în zona de lucru."

#. TRANSLATORS: Performance helptext for an Amazon production site:
#. Stonecutter's Hut, part 1
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/amazons/units.lua:1305
msgctxt "amazons_building"
msgid ""
"This building can produce one granite between %1$s and %2$s, depending on "
"how far the stonecutter has to walk."
msgstr "Această clădire poate produce un granit între %1$s și %2$s, în funcție de cât de departe trebuie să meargă pietrarul."

