msgstr "Ferreus assiduo consumitur annulus usu."

#. TRANSLATORS: Lore helptext for an Empire production site: Deep Iron Mine
#. Translation for the classical Latin quote:
#. "Ferreus assiduo consumitur annulus usu."
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:2016
msgid "By constant use an iron ring is worn away."
msgstr "Prin folosire neîncetată, chiar și un inel de fier se tocește."

#. TRANSLATORS: Lore author helptext for an Empire production site: Deep Iron
#. Mine
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:2020
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid "Amalea on the importance of always looking for more resources"
msgstr "Amalea, despre importanța căutării neîncetate a mai multor resurse"

#. TRANSLATORS: DO NOT TRANSLATE, but you may transliterate into non-latin
#. fonts.
#. Classical Latin quote meaning:
#. "Gold discovered and all the better for being so."
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:2035
msgid "Aurum irrepertum et sic melius situm."
msgstr "Aurum irrepertum et sic melius situm."

#. TRANSLATORS: Lore helptext for an Empire production site: Gold Mine
#. Translation for the classical Latin quote:
#. "Aurum irrepertum et sic melius situm."
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:2039
msgid "Gold discovered and all the better for being so."
msgstr "Aur descoperit, și cu atât mai bine că e așa."

#. TRANSLATORS: Lore author helptext for an Empire production site: Gold Mine
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:2043
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid ""
"Amalea receiving the first geologist report of gold on the small island"
msgstr "Amalea, primind primul raport al geologului despre aurul de pe insula mică"

#. TRANSLATORS: Performance helptext for an Empire production site: Gold Mine
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:2048
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:2071
#, lua-format
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid ""
"If the food supply is steady, this mine can produce gold ore in %s on "
"average."
msgstr "Dacă aprovizionarea cu hrană este constantă, această mină poate produce minereu de aur în medie în %s."

#. TRANSLATORS: DO NOT TRANSLATE, but you may transliterate into non-latin
#. fonts.
#. Classical Latin quote meaning:
#. "Gold has conquered the fear of death."
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:2058
msgid "Formidinem mortis vicit aurum."
msgstr "Formidinem mortis vicit aurum."

#. TRANSLATORS: Lore helptext for an Empire production site: Deep Gold Mine
#. Translation for the classical Latin quote:
#. "Formidinem mortis vicit aurum."
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:2062
msgid "Gold has conquered the fear of death."
msgstr "Aurul a învins frica de moarte."

#. TRANSLATORS: Lore author helptext for an Empire production site: Deep Gold
#. Mine
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:2066
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid "General Trepidus Egenus Attenuatus on motivating soldiers"
msgstr "Generalul Trepidus Egenus Attenuatus, despre motivarea soldaților"

#. TRANSLATORS: DO NOT TRANSLATE, but you may transliterate into non-latin
#. fonts.
#. Classical Latin quote meaning:
#. "[The People of the Empire] who once handed out all [power], now restrains
#. itself
#. and anxiously hopes for just two things: bread and games."
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:2084
msgid ""
"Qui dabat olim […] omnia, nunc se continet atque duas tantum res anxius "
"optat, panem et circenses."
msgstr "Qui dabat olim […] omnia, nunc se continet atque duas tantum res anxius optat, panem et circenses."

#. TRANSLATORS: Lore helptext for an Empire training site: Arena
#. Translation for the classical Latin quote:
#. "Qui dabat olim […] omnia, nunc se continet atque duas tantum res anxius
#. optat,
#. panem et circenses."
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:2090
msgid ""
"[The People of the Empire] who once handed out all [power], now restrains "
"itself and anxiously hopes for just two things: bread and games."
msgstr "[Poporul Imperiului], care odinioară împărțea toată [puterea], acum se reține și speră cu neliniște doar două lucruri: pâine și circ."

#. TRANSLATORS: Lore author helptext for an Empire training site: Arena
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:2094
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid "History of the Empire, Part X – the decline"
msgstr "Istoria Imperiului, partea a X-a – declinul"

#. TRANSLATORS: Purpose helptext for an Empire training site: Arena, part 1
#. TRANSLATORS: Purpose helptext for an Empire training site: Colosseum, part
#. 1
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:2097
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:2124
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid "Trains soldiers in ‘Evade’."
msgstr "Antrenează soldații la „Eschivă”."

#. TRANSLATORS: Purpose helptext for an Empire training site: Arena, part 2
#. TRANSLATORS: Purpose helptext for an Empire training site: Colosseum, part
#. 2
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:2099
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:2126
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid ""
"‘Evade’ increases the soldier’s chance not to be hit by the enemy and so to "
"remain totally unaffected."
msgstr "„Eschiva” crește șansa soldatului de a nu fi lovit de inamic și de a rămâne astfel complet neatins."

#. TRANSLATORS: Note helptext for an Empire training site: Arena
#. TRANSLATORS: Note helptext for an Empire training site: Colosseum
#. TRANSLATORS: Note helptext for an Empire training site: Training Camp
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:2102
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:2129
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:2162
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid ""
"Imperial soldiers cannot be trained in ‘Defense’ and will remain at the "
"level with which they came."
msgstr "Soldații imperiali nu pot fi antrenați la „Apărare” și vor rămâne la nivelul cu care au venit."

#. TRANSLATORS: Performance helptext for an Empire training site: Arena
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:2104
#, lua-format
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid ""
"If all needed wares are delivered in time, an arena can train one soldier to"
" the first level in evade in %s on average."
msgstr "Dacă toate bunurile necesare sunt livrate la timp, o arenă poate antrena un soldat până la primul nivel de eschivă în medie în %s."

#. TRANSLATORS: DO NOT TRANSLATE, but you may transliterate into non-latin
#. fonts.
#. Classical Latin quote meaning:
#. "Hail Cæsar! Those who are about to die greet you!"
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:2114
msgid "Ave Cæsar! Morituri te salutant!"
msgstr "Ave Cæsar! Morituri te salutant!"

#. TRANSLATORS: Lore helptext for an Empire training site: Colosseum
#. Translation for the classical Latin quote:
#. "Ave Cæsar! Morituri te salutant!"
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:2118
msgid "Hail Cæsar! Those who are about to die greet you!"
msgstr "Ave, Cezar! Cei ce vor muri te salută!"

#. TRANSLATORS: Lore author helptext for an Empire training site: Colosseum
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:2121
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid "Greeting from the gladiators to the emperor"
msgstr "Salutul gladiatorilor către împărat"

#. TRANSLATORS: Performance helptext for an Empire training site: Colosseum,
#. part 1
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:2132
#, lua-format
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid ""
"If all needed wares are delivered in time, a colosseum can train one soldier"
" one level in evade in %s on average."
msgstr "Dacă toate bunurile necesare sunt livrate la timp, un colosseum poate antrena un soldat cu un nivel la eschivă în medie în %s."

#. TRANSLATORS: Performance helptext for an Empire training site: Colosseum,
#. part 2
#. TRANSLATORS: Performance helptext for an Empire training site: Training
#. Camp, part 2
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:2134
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:2167
#, lua-format
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid "Complete training of one soldier takes %s on average."
msgstr "Antrenamentul complet al unui soldat durează în medie %s."

#. TRANSLATORS: DO NOT TRANSLATE, but you may transliterate into non-latin
#. fonts.
#. Classical Latin quote meaning:
#. "Fortune helps the strong."
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:2145
msgid "Fortes fortuna adiuvat."
msgstr "Fortes fortuna adiuvat."

#. TRANSLATORS: Lore helptext for an Empire training site: Training Camp
#. Translation for the classical Latin quote:
#. "Fortes fortuna adiuvat."
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:2149
msgid "Fortune helps the strong."
msgstr "Norocul îi ajută pe cei puternici."

#. TRANSLATORS: Lore author helptext for an Empire training site: Training
#. Camp
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:2153
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid "Trainer to soldiers who questioned the need for higher level training"
msgstr "Antrenorul, către soldații care puneau la îndoială nevoia de antrenament la niveluri mai înalte"

#. TRANSLATORS: Purpose helptext for an Empire training site: Training Camp,
#. part 1
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:2157
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid "Trains soldiers in ‘Attack’ and in ‘Health’."
msgstr "Antrenează soldații la „Atac” și la „Sănătate”."

#. TRANSLATORS: Purpose helptext for an Empire training site: Training Camp,
#. part 2
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:2159
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid "Equips the soldiers with all necessary weapons and armor parts."
msgstr "Echipează soldații cu toate armele și piesele de armură necesare."

#. TRANSLATORS: Performance helptext for an Empire training site: Training
#. Camp, part 1
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:2165
#, lua-format
msgctxt "empire_building"
